  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54b924c759354c19",
      "translationZh": "SetFitABSA 是一种高效的技术，用于检测文本中针对特定方面的情感。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91adc7fade93f9bb",
      "translationZh": "基于方面的情感分析（Aspect-Based Sentiment Analysis，ABSA）是一项检测文本中针对特定方面的情感的任务。例如，在句子“这部手机的屏幕很棒，但电池太小了”中，方面词是“屏幕”和“电池”，针对它们的情感极性分别为正面和负面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd6eb0f6a43434dc",
      "translationZh": "各类组织广泛使用 ABSA，通过分析客户对不同领域中产品或服务各个方面的反馈来提取有价值的洞察。然而，为 ABSA 标注训练数据是一项繁琐的任务，因为在训练样本中手动识别方面需要进行细粒度（词元级别）的标注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24673688878d312e",
      "translationZh": "Intel Labs 和 Hugging Face 很高兴推出 SetFitABSA，这是一个用于对特定领域的 ABSA 模型进行少样本训练的框架；在少样本场景下，SetFitABSA 具有很强的竞争力，甚至优于 Llama2 和 T5 等生成式模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b36d0b62564ca0db",
      "translationZh": "与基于大语言模型的方法相比，SetFitABSA 有两个独特优势：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ab61ed945f27333",
      "translationZh": "🗣 无需提示词：使用大语言模型进行少样本上下文学习需要手工设计提示词，这会使结果不够稳健、对措辞敏感，并且依赖用户的专业能力。SetFitABSA 直接从少量已标注的文本示例中生成丰富的嵌入表示，从而完全不需要提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ef2c3d8fad9c243",
      "translationZh": "🏎 训练快速：SetFitABSA 只需要少量已标注的训练样本；此外，它采用简单的训练数据格式，无需专门的标注工具。这使得数据标注过程既快捷又轻松。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c5f927d5663f408",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们将介绍 SetFitABSA 的工作原理，以及如何使用 SetFit 库训练你自己的模型。让我们开始吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c3f15799af503a46",
      "translationZh": "它是如何工作的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15b648875bccf1ce",
      "translationZh": "SetFitABSA 的三阶段训练过程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88101d8a8bea29f3",
      "translationZh": "SetFitABSA 包含三个步骤。第一步从文本中提取方面候选项，第二步将方面候选项分类为方面或非方面，从而得到方面，最后一步为每个提取出的方面关联一种情感极性。第二步和第三步基于 SetFit 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36a798e3f39239cc",
      "translationZh": "训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db066fb8d0e00cd1",
      "translationZh": "1. 方面候选项提取",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a0092caaa8b9548",
      "translationZh": "在这项工作中，我们假设方面通常是产品和服务的特征，且大多是名词或复合名词（由连续名词组成的字符串）。我们使用 spaCy 对（少样本）训练集中的句子进行分词，并从中提取名词或复合名词。由于提取出的名词或复合名词并非都是方面，我们将它们称为方面候选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5736766280182f0",
      "translationZh": "2. 方面/非方面分类",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db841aa2b76cefe1",
      "translationZh": "现在我们已经有了方面候选项，需要训练一个模型，使其能够区分哪些名词是方面，哪些名词不是方面。为此，我们需要带有方面/非方面标签的训练样本。具体做法是：将训练集中的方面视为真正的方面并标记为 True，而将其他与这些方面不重叠的方面候选项视为非方面，因此标记为 False：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c91858c236a496cd",
      "translationZh": "训练句子：“服务员不太友好，但奶油意大利面简直好吃得不得了。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9120e74071b92b8f",
      "translationZh": "分词结果：[Waiters, are, n't, friendly, but, the, cream, pasta, is, out, of, this, world, .]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e81bfa1d9ade443",
      "translationZh": "提取出的方面候选项：[Waiters, are, n't, friendly, but, the, cream, pasta, is, out, of, this, world, .]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0720b938512816a5",
      "translationZh": "训练集中的金标准标签，采用 BIO 格式：[B-ASP, O, O, O, O, O, B-ASP, I-ASP, O, O, O, O, O, .]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed58c18d795f8d6d",
      "translationZh": "生成的方面／非方面标签：[Waiters, are, n't, friendly, but, the, cream, pasta, is, out, of, this, world, .]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4950a188a7dccb59",
      "translationZh": "现在，所有方面候选项都已标注完毕，我们该如何利用这些标注来训练候选方面分类模型呢？换句话说，我们该如何使用句子分类框架 SetFit 对单个词元进行分类呢？诀窍就在这里：将每个方面候选项与完整的训练句子拼接起来，使用以下模板创建一个训练实例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f50c89829b2aa47",
      "translationZh": "将该模板应用于上面的示例，将生成 3 个训练实例——其中两个带有 True 标签，表示方面训练实例；另一个带有 False 标签，表示非方面训练实例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71988c4d8e0803ba",
      "translationZh": "文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e66373f45dcf3dd",
      "translationZh": "标签",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d81612ba96f8fc5",
      "translationZh": "服务员：服务员不太友好，但奶油意面简直好吃极了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a545e2c4e799aa96",
      "translationZh": "奶油意面：服务员不太友好，但奶油意面简直好吃极了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8725de00a4cde7d1",
      "translationZh": "世界：服务员不太友好，但奶油意面简直好吃极了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16f0710a15ab1786",
      "translationZh": "生成训练实例后，我们就可以利用 SetFit 的强大能力，训练一个面向特定领域的小样本二元分类器，从输入的评论文本中提取方面。这将是我们的第一个经过微调的 SetFit 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6a09dc992a6bbe2",
      "translationZh": "3. 情感极性分类",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec486016d22e2e62",
      "translationZh": "系统从文本中提取出各个方面后，需要为每个方面关联一种情感极性（例如正面、负面或中性）。为此，我们使用第 2 个 SetFit 模型，并采用与方面提取模型类似的方式进行训练，如下例所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c91858c236a496cd",
      "translationZh": "训练句子：“服务员不太友好，但奶油意面简直好吃极了。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9120e74071b92b8f",
      "translationZh": "分词结果：[Waiters, are, n't, friendly, but, the, cream, pasta, is, out, of, this, world, .]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae59fbcedfac2c3c",
      "translationZh": "训练集中的标准标签：[NEG, O, O, O, O, O, POS, POS, O, O, O, O, O, .]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71988c4d8e0803ba",
      "translationZh": "文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e66373f45dcf3dd",
      "translationZh": "标签",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d81612ba96f8fc5",
      "translationZh": "服务员：服务员不太友好，但奶油意面简直好吃极了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a545e2c4e799aa96",
      "translationZh": "奶油意面：服务员不太友好，但奶油意面简直好吃极了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea16b2e6600910dc",
      "translationZh": "请注意，与方面抽取模型不同，我们没有在这个训练集中包含非方面项，因为目标是对真实方面的情感极性进行分类。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a4cf07959569d939",
      "translationZh": "运行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b69181f701229903",
      "translationZh": "在推理时，测试句子会经过 spaCy 方面候选项抽取阶段，按照 aspect_candidate:test_sentence 模板生成测试实例。接下来，方面/非方面分类器会过滤掉非方面项。最后，抽取出的方面会被送入情感极性分类器，由其预测每个方面的情感极性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc8fccb267dc8d7e",
      "translationZh": "在实际应用中，这意味着模型可以接收普通文本作为输入，并输出方面及其对应的情感：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ea5af873a80bfbb",
      "translationZh": "模型输入：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dade010f3d7dd963",
      "translationZh": "模型输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "181bd78389db3350",
      "translationZh": "基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdc884b56b7f8a3d",
      "translationZh": "我们将 SetFitABSA 与 AWS AI Labs 和 Salesforce AI Research 近期达到最先进水平的工作进行了基准比较，这些工作使用提示来微调 T5 和 GPT2。为了更全面地了解性能，我们还通过上下文学习，将我们的模型与 Llama-2-chat 模型进行比较。我们使用了来自 2014 年语义评测挑战赛（SemEval14）的热门 ABSA 数据集 Laptop14 和 Restaurant14。我们既在方面术语抽取（SB1）这一中间任务上评估 SetFitABSA，也在抽取方面并预测其情感极性的完整 ABSA 任务（SB1+SB2）上进行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f9f69786bbef4132",
      "translationZh": "模型规模对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7a6decbc01f34fc",
      "translationZh": "规模（参数量）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b57bcfbcec21a1a9",
      "translationZh": "请注意，对于 SB1 任务，SetFitABSA 的参数量为 110M；对于 SB2，参数量为 110M；而对于 SB1+SB2，SetFitABSA 的参数量为 220M。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fc257468c25fa51b",
      "translationZh": "性能比较",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30b654b10d819b64",
      "translationZh": "我们可以看到，当训练样本数量较少时，SetFitABSA 具有明显优势，尽管其规模仅为 T5 的 1/2、GPT2-medium 的 1/3。即使与规模是其 64 倍的 Llama 2 相比，其性能也相当或更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "418950c9fec50c85",
      "translationZh": "SetFitABSA 与 GPT2 的对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "caf18407e964692f",
      "translationZh": "SetFitABSA 与 T5 的对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e467fbec8d720f22",
      "translationZh": "请注意，为了公平比较，我们在将 SetFitABSA 与各个基线（GPT2、T5 等）进行比较时，使用了与这些基线完全相同的数据集划分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a6b8c43c82dc2cf",
      "translationZh": "SetFitABSA 与 Llama2 的对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06285736219ac912",
      "translationZh": "我们注意到，增加 Llama2 的上下文训练样本数量并未带来性能提升。此前在 ChatGPT 上也曾出现过这种现象，我们认为应对此进行进一步研究。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bcca8dc34b493495",
      "translationZh": "训练你自己的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7767cbbd250e9f0",
      "translationZh": "SetFitABSA 是 SetFit 框架的一部分。要训练 ABSA 模型，请先安装 setfit，并启用 absa 选项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "036d2311a1c67e47",
      "translationZh": "此外，我们还必须安装 en_core_web_lg spaCy 模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b504d3b33167d78b",
      "translationZh": "接下来，我们准备训练集。训练集的格式为 Dataset，包含 text、span、label、ordinal 这几列：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7472c9f18fe4b8d5",
      "translationZh": "text：包含各个方面的完整句子或文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4a2ff26bc5183b0",
      "translationZh": "span：完整句子中的一个方面，可以由多个词组成。例如：“food”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f47317ea998113b6",
      "translationZh": "label：与方面片段对应的（情感极性）标签。例如：“positive”。在为收集到的训练数据进行标注时，可以任意选择标签名称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d6f215c9f0da2524",
      "translationZh": "ordinal：如果某个方面片段在文本中出现多次，则该序号表示这些出现位置的索引。通常该值就是 0，因为每个方面在输入文本中一般只出现一次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7116046c10897809",
      "translationZh": "例如，训练文本“这家餐厅的食物很棒，但服务是我见过最差的”包含两个方面，因此会在训练集表中添加两行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71988c4d8e0803ba",
      "translationZh": "文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b0e83c19eb41845",
      "translationZh": "片段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e66373f45dcf3dd",
      "translationZh": "标签",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f266bc53af518cc",
      "translationZh": "序数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18e8f5fbf1405be4",
      "translationZh": "这家餐厅的食物很棒，但服务是我见过最差的",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1f026582fe6e8cb",
      "translationZh": "食物",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afa6e9ab3ac6574d",
      "translationZh": "正面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18e8f5fbf1405be4",
      "translationZh": "这家餐厅的食物很棒，但服务是我见过最差的",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9df6b026a8c6c26e",
      "translationZh": "服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09f04951af4cd503",
      "translationZh": "负面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f89656de1548a46",
      "translationZh": "准备好训练数据集后，我们就可以创建一个 ABSA 训练器并执行训练。SetFit 模型的训练效率相当高，但由于 SetFitABSA 涉及两个按顺序训练的模型，因此建议使用 GPU 进行训练，以缩短训练时间。例如，下面的训练脚本使用免费的 Google Colab T4 GPU，在大约 10 分钟内即可训练出一个完整的 SetFitABSA 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "289d34c962f550eb",
      "translationZh": "就是这样！我们已经训练出了一个特定领域的 ABSA 模型。我们可以将训练好的模型保存到磁盘，或上传到 Hugging Face hub。请记住，该模型包含两个子模型，因此需要为每个子模型指定各自的路径：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f55714daed131784",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们可以使用训练好的模型进行推理。首先加载模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a8495305aa1ac53",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们使用 predict API 运行推理。输入是一个字符串列表，每个字符串代表一条文本评论：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b82cdae64e799caf",
      "translationZh": "有关训练选项、模型保存与加载以及推理的更多详情，请参阅 SetFit 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69824d3b0e70ca6a",
      "translationZh": "参考文献",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97dbcdda8a5f9866",
      "translationZh": "Maria Pontiki、Dimitris Galanis、John Pavlopoulos、Harris Papageorgiou、Ion Androutsopoulos 和 Suresh Manandhar。2014。SemEval-2014 任务 4：基于方面的情感分析。载于《第 8 届国际语义评估研讨会论文集》（SemEval 2014），第 27–35 页。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb340732e59907fa",
      "translationZh": "Siddharth Varia、Shuai Wang、Kishaloy Halder、Robert Vacareanu、Miguel Ballesteros、Yassine Benajiba、Neha Anna John、Rishita Anubhai、Smaranda Muresan、Dan Roth，2023。《面向少样本方面级情感分析的指令微调》。https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.06629",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38ef2f5f1343dd35",
      "translationZh": "Ehsan Hosseini-Asl, Wenhao Liu, Caiming Xiong, 2022.《用于少样本方面级情感分析的生成式语言模型》。https://arxiv.org/abs/2204.05356",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c207a112ebe0fc98",
      "translationZh": "Lewis Tunstall, Nils Reimers, Unso Eun Seo Jo, Luke Bates, Daniel Korat, Moshe Wasserblat, Oren Pereg, 2022.《无需提示的高效少样本学习》。https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.11055",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
